  m_Name: RiverSteamDockyard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: RiverSteamDockyard
  displayName: Steam Dockyard
  description: An ironclad in a dry dock under an iron gantry, brick sheds and a
    smoking chimney. Trains Ironclads; its ferry seats 10. Build it on the shore
    of open water. Its boats patrol the water and shoot at raiders near the shore;
    send troops to land the water cuts off and its ferry carries them across.
